 beyonce_dev
        "## Problem Statement 3: Insurance Claim Experience Analyzer\n",
        "An insurance company wants to analyze customer comments about the claim process. Positive feedback can indicate efficient service, while negative feedback can reveal delays, communication problems, or dissatisfaction with claim settlements."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": 6,
      "id": "UoM6s5gBJDP3",

        "## Problem Statement 3: Complaint triage with a confidence threshold\n",
        "A support team should escalate strongly negative complaints, and send low-confidence ones to a human (the model is not always correct)."
      ],
      "id": "GX4QP4BrJDP2"
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
 main
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "UoM6s5gBJDP3",
 beyonce_dev
        "outputId": "01e40245-17ba-4517-b267-97b524a854a1"
      },

        "outputId": "e0438739-3fe9-4c12-8720-e17c4c5a0fdb"
      },
      "execution_count": null,
 main
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
 beyonce_dev
            "REGULAR         | POSITIVE 0.99 | My health insurance claim was processed quickly and without any problems.\n",
            "PRIORITY REVIEW | NEGATIVE 1.00 | I have been waiting for weeks with no update about my claim.\n",
            "REGULAR         | POSITIVE 1.00 | The customer service executive explained the process very clearly.\n",
            "PRIORITY REVIEW | NEGATIVE 1.00 | My claim was rejected and nobody properly explained why.\n",
            "PRIORITY REVIEW | NEGATIVE 1.00 | The reimbursement reached my account earlier than expected.\n"

            "ESCALATE                               | NEGATIVE 1.00 | My money was deducted twice and nobody is replying!\n",
            "ESCALATE                               | NEGATIVE 1.00 | The statement download is a bit slow.\n",
            "ESCALATE                               | NEGATIVE 1.00 | Is the new interest rate applicable to old accounts?\n",
            "NO ACTION                              | POSITIVE 1.00 | Excellent service, my loan was approved quickly.\n"
 main
          ]
        }
      ],
      "source": [
 beyonce_dev
        "claim_feedback = [\n",
        "    \"My health insurance claim was processed quickly and without any problems.\",\n",
        "    \"I have been waiting for weeks with no update about my claim.\",\n",
        "    \"The customer service executive explained the process very clearly.\",\n",
        "    \"My claim was rejected and nobody properly explained why.\",\n",
        "    \"The reimbursement reached my account earlier than expected.\",\n",
        "]\n",
        "\n",
        "results = sentiment(claim_feedback)\n",
        "\n",
        "for text, r in zip(claim_feedback, results):\n",
        "    if r[\"label\"] == \"NEGATIVE\" and r[\"score\"] >= 0.85:\n",
        "        action = \"PRIORITY REVIEW\"\n",
        "    else:\n",
        "        action = \"REGULAR\"\n",
        "\n",
        "    print(f\"{action:15} | {r['label']:8} {r['score']:.2f} | {text}\")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "6HGNz8n9JDP3",

        "complaints = [\n",
        "    \"My money was deducted twice and nobody is replying!\",\n",
        "    \"The statement download is a bit slow.\",\n",
        "    \"Is the new interest rate applicable to old accounts?\",\n",
        "    \"Excellent service, my loan was approved quickly.\",\n",
        "]\n",
        "THRESHOLD = 0.90\n",
        "for text, r in zip(complaints, sentiment(complaints)):\n",
        "    if r[\"score\"] < THRESHOLD:\n",
        "        action = \"SEND TO HUMAN REVIEW (low confidence)\"\n",
        "    elif r[\"label\"] == \"NEGATIVE\":\n",
        "        action = \"ESCALATE\"\n",
        "    else:\n",
